e increases, the other decreases)\n\nWe will be dealing with Pearson coefficient in this section","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"**Q3.1 Calculate the Pearson correlation coefficient between the CO2 concentration and the different temperature metrics**","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"cc_land_temp <- cor(merged$CO2_ppm_avg, merged$LandAvgTemp_avg, use = \"pairwise.complete.obs\")\ncc_land_ocean_temp <- cor(merged$CO2_ppm_avg, merged$LandOceanAvgTemp_avg, use = \"pairwise.complete.obs\")\n\nprint(paste(\"Pearson correlation between CO2 and Land Average Temperature:\", cc_land_temp))\nprint(paste(\"Pearson correlation between CO2 and Land and Ocean Average Temperature:\", cc_land_ocean_temp))","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2025-09-04T16:47:03.705446Z","iopub.execute_input":"2025-09-04T16:47:03.707181Z","iopub.status.idle":"2025-09-04T16:47:03.743275Z","shell.execute_reply":"2025-09-04T16:47:03.740716Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"[1] \"Pearson correlation between CO2 and Land Average Temperature: 0.902903649303398\"\n[1] \"Pearson correlation between CO2 and Land and Ocean Average Temperature: 0.917267367877227\"\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":13},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"**Q3.2 Visualise the values using line graphs and scatter plots for each temperature metric**","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"ggplot(merged, aes(x = Year)) +\n  geom_line(aes(y = CO2_ppm_avg, color = \"CO2 (ppm)\"), linetype = \"dashed\") +\n  geom_line(aes(y = LandAvgTemp_avg * 10, color = \"Land Avg Temp (°C)\"), linetype = \"solid\") + \n  scale_y_continuous(\n    name = \"CO2 (ppm)\",\n    sec.axis = sec_axis(~./10, name = \"Temperature (°C)\")\n  ) +\n  labs(title = \"Annual CO2 and Land Temperature Trends (1958-2015)\",\n       x = \"Year\",\n       color = \"Metric\") +\n  theme_minimal()\n\nggplot(merged, aes(x = Year)) +\n  geom_line(aes(y = CO2_ppm_avg, color = \"CO2 (ppm)\"), linetype = \"dashed\") +\n  geom_line(aes(y = LandOceanAvgTemp_avg * 10, color = \"Land & Ocean Avg Temp (°C)\"), linetype = \"solid\") + \n  scale_y_continuous(\n    name = \"CO2 (ppm)\",\n    sec.axis = sec_axis(~./10, name = \"Temperature (°C)\")\n  ) +\n  labs(title = \"Annual CO2 and Land & Ocean Temperature Trends (1958-2015)\",\n       x = \"Year\",\n       color = \"Metric\") +\n  theme_minimal()\nggplot(merged, aes(x = CO2_ppm_avg, y = LandAvgTemp_avg)) +\n  geom_point() +\n  geom_smooth(method = \"lm\", se = FALSE) +\n  labs(title = \"Scatter Plot of CO2 vs. Land Average Temperature\",\n       x = \"Annual CO2 Concentration (ppm)\",\n       y = \"Annual Land Average Temperature (°C)\") +\n  theme_minimal()\n\nggplot(merged, aes(x = CO2_ppm_avg, y = LandOceanAvgTemp_avg)) +\n  geom_point() +\n  geom_smooth(method = \"lm\", se = FALSE) +\n  labs(title = \"Scatter Plot of CO2 vs. Land & Ocean Average Temperature\",\n       x = \"Annual CO2 Concentration (ppm)\",\n       y = \"Annual Land & Ocean Average Temperature (°C)\") +\n  theme_minimal()","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2025-09-04T16:48:20.052309Z","iopub.execute_input":"2025-09-04T16:48:20.054117Z","iopub.status.idle":"2025-09-04T16:48:21.194571Z","shell.execute_reply":"2025-09-04T16:48:21.192608Z"}},"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"image/png":"iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAA0gAAANICAIAAAByhViMAAAABmJLR0QA/wD/AP+gvaeTAAAg\nAElEQVR4nOzdd3wUdf7H8c93ZnfTe0KAEHrvRTqIVLGgYO+K5Wzo2XvBenqevf/Us9xZz4IF\nLIgFBKSICopIE1B6ek92Z+b3x4YQQrLZQNhJZl/PP3jsfue7O5/vZph57+wUZVmWAAAAoPnT\n7C4AAAAAjYNgBwAA4BAEOwAAAIcg2AEAADgEwQ4AAMAhCHYAAAAOQbADAABwCIIdAACAQzgz\n2Flmcddoj1JK0z3Li7x2lxOslQ8OVkqN/3BTvT0to3DWM3efPGlYZsvUKLcnIbnFgFFH3vTI\nf7O8Zh2vMBa8/czfTpnUpX1GfJQnIaVl9/6jL73pge82FTXqCA65RzslKaXm5JbVOrV4+9NK\nqciEUSGuan+B61x6dR8VhON+3h3issNQE/9bBF6QGqQif1GnKPe9P2XXOjX/9++//W7twc+l\neTngUVtm8fEtYqY990ujlwQcPGcGu+xVN60r9YqIZXpveH+T3eU0suKtXx3ZOWPa5Xe+O3fJ\n7hJJz0hXpTk/LfziwWvP7th10qLsmtuA0h3zpw