l details and reasoning.\n\nBased on our dataset, the missing values in the Ozone_level(ppb) column are best categorized as Missing at Random (MAR). The missingness isn't a fluke, it's likely connected to other factors we've observed, specifically humidity and the location type.","metadata":{}}]}
